WEBVTT

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:42.310
Haruka-neesama is going to study abroad?

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:44.200
Surely something like that isn't possible, is it?

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:49.410
I don't want to believe it either. However, it's the truth.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.420
I'm going to confirm it with Haruka-neesama.

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:57.660
Wait, don't do that!

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:00.090
Why not? Let me go!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:05.150
Hey, if you of all people ask her...
This is Haruka we're talking about.

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:08.720
Isn't it obvious that she would tell us that
she'd give up studying abroad for our sake?

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.270
Wouldn't that be better?

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:18.060
Why don't you be a little more thoughtful? This is Haruka's future, you know!

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:21.970
Would it be all right to have her let this chance slip away because of us, her younger sisters?

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:26.770
I haven't heard anything about it.

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:30.470
If you think about Haruka's capabilities, Japan is certainly too small.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:33.870
This is a chance that the world-class Haruka hasn't even dreamed of!

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:36.760
Well, yeah, but...

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.360
Wait, Kana-chan.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:43.520
Haruka hasn't told you and Chiaki because she isn't ready to decide.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.350
But if Haruka really does wish to study abroad, I hope that you will support her.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.240
Yes, yes.

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:55.350
Shouldn't we support her decision?

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:07.070
That's why, as her sisters, shouldn't we be celebrating this happy occasion?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.600
Right?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.010
Let's send her off with a smile.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:19.010
This is Africa's Bobonba Kingdom.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:22.090
Here, you can see a lot of wild animals.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:26.300
Lately, there has been a lot of tourism...

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.970
That looks so nice. I'd love to go there.

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:34.160
Hmm? What is it?

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.960
No, it's nothing.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.060
Gimme seconds!

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.640
Okay, okay.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.130
You can certainly eat a lot.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.960
The rice Haruka cooks is the best in the world.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.580
Since I'm able to eat it, that makes me the happiest person in the world!

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:56.210
What's that all about?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.290
Okay, here you go.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:02.720
Good, good! This is what you call exquisite cooking!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:05.300
Delicious!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.040
Ah, Chiaki, good morning!

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.110
Good morning.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:18.310
Hey, is it true that Haruka-san is going to study abroad?

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:22.770
I was surprised when Kana-chan contacted me.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:27.700
That's amazing, isn't it? I want to go abroad, too!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.980
Paris, London, New York!

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.950
Antarctica, the Chinese provinces, the Amazon!

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.030
What's with those choices?

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.790
Penguin, panda, anaconda, of course!

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:43.590
Why is Haruka-san leaving me behind?

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.010
It's probably because there's no reason to take you, right?

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:48.880
But Haruka-san is amazing, isn't she?

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:52.140
Compared to us, her intellectual capability is totally different!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.600
...us?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:59.120
I'm sure that she'll come home an even more splendid person!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.990
So, should we do it at school?

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:09.910
Since Chiaki-chan's friends will be there too, shouldn't we choose some place else?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.780
I guess Haruka's house would be best.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:17.580
No, no. To dumbfound her, we must choose an original place that nobody would think of.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.540
Is it important that we dumbfound her?

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:24.990
Of course it is! Something normal would be boring.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:29.860
You can't be serious! I don't really want to be associated with Hayami-senpai's games...

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.120
This isn't a game!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.990
Minami Haruka is going to study abroad?

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:38.110
If that's the case, I'll have to get a passport first.

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:42.600
My my, there are a lot of important preparations to do.

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:56.740
To think that a parting like this would occur...

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.600
You'll be lonely, won't you?

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.250
Yeah.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:06.160
It's okay. No matter how far you go, we'll still be friends.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.760
Be well, okay?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.610
I'll write you letters.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.100
Not me. Haruka's the one going.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:23.690
Keiko-san, you aren't disappointed right now, are you?

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:25.850
I'm not, I'm not.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:30.570
Anyway, I want to send Haruka off without her having any worries. What should I do?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.820
Well, in that case...

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.530
Chores?

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:47.520
That's right! Until now, Haruka has been doing all of the chores for us.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:50.950
We can't do anything without Haruka. That's no good!

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.510
You're one to talk.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:57.730
We'll show her that we can easily handle all of the housework right here!

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.600
But will you guys be all right?

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:06.020
Just leave it to me! We have "Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So"!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.520
"Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So"?

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.340
Well, Keiko was saying...

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:12.820
The basis of household chores is "Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So".

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:16.610
If you can do that, I'm sure Haruka-san will approve of your efforts.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:19.530
How's that? Understand now?

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:21.580
I don't get it at all.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.220
What is "Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So"?

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.590
That's... something I don't remember!

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:41.970
It's probably an acronym for the different types of household chores.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:44.910
Sa-Sasou to?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.230
Shi-Shikkari...?

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.840
A-Apple.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:50.920
Gorilla.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.850
Trumpet.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:52.730
Panda.

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:53.490
Dango.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.200
Gorilla.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:54.910
Trumpet.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:55.580
Panda.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:56.460
Be quiet.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:56.980
Okay.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:01.150
Hey, Kana! What was the urgent business?

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:05.200
Oh, you came at a good time! What exactly is "Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So"?

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:10.640
"Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So" is "Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So", and things like that, right?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.410
The "Sa-Shi-Su-Se-So" of household chores!

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:16.560
Oh that! I've heard of that before.

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:19.390
"So" is for souji, or something like that.

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:24.210
So that's what it is? If it's souji...

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:26.980
"Se" is "sentaku," and "su" would be...

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:30.310
Suisen toilet, I wonder?

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:31.710
It's for suiji.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:34.150
"Sa" is for saihou, I think?

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.440
So what's left is... "shi"?

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:40.060
Oh, oh, oh! Shitsukeru!

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.280
Sit!

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:45.790
Eh? Tomorrow?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.000
I'm free, but...

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:51.000
Okay, I guess it can't be helped.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.230
Only for this time.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.260
Okay, good night.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.680
And now, we shall begin our operations!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:06.100
Our objective: to make a meal with our own hands.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:10.740
With today's special training, we're going to find out the kind of flavoring that will astound Haruka.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:14.570
To achieve that taste, we're asking for your generous support!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.140
This is all for Haruka's sake!

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:21.100
Is cooking all we need to do for our training?

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:24.340
Well, it's the only one that we can't fake our way out of.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:28.630
It's better to perfect this than to overextend ourselves and end up being incompetent in all areas.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:32.380
My eyes are stinging...

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.540
Patience, patience.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:38.950
I know. But even so, they won't stop!

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:42.720
As the food testers, we ask you not to hold back in your criticism.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:47.970
That's all right, but... are we going to be fed actual food?

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:49.160
Just leave it to me!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:52.770
By the way, where is Haruka-san?

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:56.540
Maki-chan asked for her, so she went out to a volleyball match.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.110
She won't be coming home until evening.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:02.000
What the heck. How boring.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.830
Hey, if Haruka were around, there wouldn't be any meaning to our secret training, would there?

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:09.080
Y-Yes, that's correct...

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:16.590
This texture somehow manages to grow on you.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.520
No, not really.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:21.800
Mixing it between my fingers, just mixing it like this.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.330
Hey, something smells!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.830
Kana-chan, the heat is too strong!

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.910
It's okay! There's no problem!

00:10:58.910 --> 00:10:59.670
Liar!

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.910
I wonder if we were too easygoing with it...

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.670
Don't be afraid of fire!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.500
*Gulp*

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.180
In any case, this is the first course.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.480
Minced meat?

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.140
More like a minced meat burger.

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:16.560
Has it been tasted yet?

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.770
I-Isn't that your job?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.640
For the chopped ingredients,

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:28.520
maybe there wasn't enough green onion? Maybe not enough raw ingredients?

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.990
Chiaki-sama, please let me use this.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.760
This time it won't fall apart.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:42.540
But somehow it's unusually rubbery...

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:48.290
It's kind of... slimy.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:51.220
My teeth, it's stuck to my teeth!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.980
It's burning! It's burning Kana-chan!

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:14.310
Y-You're wrong! This is called "flambe"!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:18.370
What's "flambe"? Is it the plate? The seasoning?

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:23.880
No matter what, I have to cook a delicious hamburger for Haruka!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:28.340
But my spirit is on the verge of being crushed!

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:30.040
Keep it together, Kana-chan!

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:33.920
That's right, this is for Haruka!

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.670
Ohagi burger.

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:41.860
Charred burger.

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:50.020
It has to do with the air. It says here that removing the air from the burgers will make them less likely to fall apart.

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.700
I guess we found the secret, right?

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:53.820
Yeah.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:06.710
All right! Let's head into the third set just like that!

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:23.450
We made a lot, didn't we?

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.000
Yeah, we did.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.030
It's really come together.

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:30.070
With this, I wonder if our technique is close to perfect.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:35.280
You've tried your best until now. I'm sure Haruka-san will be glad.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.700
Hey, Kana! It looks like we're done here.

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:45.730
All that's left is for you to cook it just right.

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:46.620
Leave it to me!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:50.130
I'll show you that I can cook a perfect hamburger!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.320
Still awake?

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.970
Just cooking alone is really hard.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:16.580
Doing the laundry, cleaning and the like...
Haruka's been able to do it so easily on her own.

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.570
Did you just realize that now?

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:22.960
That's probably why she chose to go study abroad, right?

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:25.830
Tomorrow, only the two of us should do the chores-

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:26.660
I know!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.790
I'm sure that Haruka will return an incredible person.

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:33.220
The world's banchou, Super Haruka!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.210
We'll send her off with a smile.

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:38.590
I know.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.400
Good night.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.590
What?

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.550
Good morning...

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:18.350
Good morning, Haruka-neesama.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.260
Sorry, did we wake you up?

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:23.230
What are the two of you doing?

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.020
As you can see, we're cleaning!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.730
Haruka-neesama, please go and sleep some more.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.900
Today, we'll handle the cleaning, laundry, and all of the chores.

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:33.700
Why, all of a sudden?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.520
Today is "Big Sister Appreciation Day".

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:39.070
It's as she says. Yes, yes.

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:43.750
I don't really get it, but it's okay to leave it to you, right?

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.710
Yeah! Leave it to us!

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:52.210
Chiaki, how much detergent should I put in?

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:54.920
It's written in the instructions, isn't it?

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.860
What are you doing, you idiot?!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:09.650
What's going on?

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.980
That was close.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.720
Hey, can I help?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.890
Your concern is unnecessary!

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.680
Is that so?

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.080
We can't be depending on her.

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:53.400
Today we'll do it ourselves.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:05.900
How is it?

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:10.680
It's the hamburger that I mastered after
making Touma and Makoto toilet residents.

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:12.540
I'm just putting on the finishing touches.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.830
Looks delicious!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.860
Let's eat!

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:24.550
By all means.

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:37.320
It's delicious!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.830
All right!

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:42.070
It's really good! You two are amazing!

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.470
What? If we get serious then this is nothing!

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.410
We're so happy that you like it!

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.850
Thank you so much for your efforts.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:55.060
To think that Kana and Chiaki would be doing the chores... I was quite surprised.

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:59.420
No, I'm really happy. Thank you, you guys.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:02.070
No, really!

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.770
Haruka-neesama...

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:09.020
With this, Haruka will be able to go traveling without any worries.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.350
Go off into the world!

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:14.230
We'll be all right.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:19.320
We can do things like the household chores, so there's nothing to worry about.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:20.240
So...

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:23.990
Hey, Chiaki! We were going to send her off smiling, right?

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.450
But... but...

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:30.000
What's going on, you two?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.410
I don't want...

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:36.080
Haruka-neesama! I don't want you to go study abroad!

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.680
Chiaki?

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:40.380
I don't want you to go to another country!

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:43.390
Don't go, Haruka-neesama!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:47.510
Hey, Chiaki! That's a violation of our rule!

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:51.310
That's... not fair...

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:56.810
In that case... In that case, me too...

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:00.320
Haruka!

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:02.850
Kana!

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.460
Don't go!

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:10.120
Who told you that I was going to study abroad?

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.410
Maki-chan said that you'd be studying abroad...

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:18.960
I'm not studying abroad.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.770
Really?

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:28.510
Isn't it obvious? Do you think I would go and leave you two behind?

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.250
Is that true?

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.550
You're being too persistent.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.220
Haruka-neesama!

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:51.180
Ladies and gentlemen, this plane will arrive in San Francisco at 19:00.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:54.280
Wait for me, Minami Haruka!
